OL,3,GNEWSAEndometriosis trial gives hope to
OL,4,Amillions of women in pain like me
OL,5,
OL,6,FCharlotte McCann has been dealing with
OL,7,Fsevere pain from endometriosis since
OL,8,Fshe was 14. It became so intolerable as
OL,9,Fan adult she had to leave her chosen
OL,10,Fcareer.
OL,12,FShe would wake up in the night
OL,13,Fvomiting, and on some days Charlotte
OL,14,Ffound she could not stand or get out of
OL,15,Fbed.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,425,420,260,160,0,100
