OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,.*,%-. * *,$%** %-& (,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAEndometriosis trial gives hope to
OL,4,Amillions of women in pain like me
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is a myth that endometriosis is a
OL,7,Fpainful period condition - rather, it
OL,8,Fis a system-wide inflammatory disease
OL,9,Fwhere cells, similar to those which
OL,10,Fline the womb, start to grow in other
OL,11,Fparts of the body. This can be on the
OL,12,Fbowel or in the lungs - and the cells
OL,13,Fmultiply, creating raw and angry sores.
OL,15,FThose affected can wait years for
OL,16,Fdiagnosis, and there is no cure -
OL,17,Fmeaning women are left grappling with
OL,18,Fdebilitating pain that can affect their
OL,19,Frelationships, work, education and
OL,20,Fmental health.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
